{"id":786504,"title":"02｜什么是Agent？","content":"AI agent可视为人类的智能助理，负责执行任务。其设计模仿了人类的认知与行为模式，主要包含三个核心能力：感知、决策和执行。感知能力使agent能够接收并理解来自外界的信息，如文本、图像或音频；决策能力由大模型构成，类似于人类的大脑，负责处理信息并制定行动计划；执行能力则让agent根据计划采取行动，通过调用外部工具完成具体任务。以查询天气预报为例，当用户询问是否需要带伞时，AI agent首先通过感知系统获取请求，然后利用大模型分析需求，决定查询天气预报，并基于结果告知用户是否携带雨伞。这一过程展示了AI agent如何模拟人类思维流程，从接收到任务到最终完成，全程自动化地解决问题。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":391849,"user_name":"6点无痛早起学习的和尚","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1703256,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"33A8A1CDA103F9","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/19/fd/58/1af629c7.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1719275541,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":142638,"content":"太多了。gpts、语聚ai、 fastgpt、dbgpt等等","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1719027,"ctime":1720787775,"ip_address":"山东","comment_id":391849,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":3,"race_medal":2,"score":2,"product_id":100775901,"comment_content":"想问一下，这个智能体课程用的是 coze 、GPTs 来做吗？还是用的哪个平台？","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1719027,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1a/3a/f3/106ff941.jpg","nickname":"周文洋","note":"","ucode":"61D85493E804D1","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":647940,"discussion_content":"太多了。gpts、语聚ai、 fastgpt、dbgpt等等","content_length":30,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1720787775,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"山东","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]},{"author":{"id":1719027,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1a/3a/f3/106ff941.jpg","nickname":"周文洋","note":"","ucode":"61D85493E804D1","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","ni